    "license": "MIT",
    "converted": "2026-11-17",
    "tuning": [
      "source selection: groove entry 'synth-pop' (pop_rnb.ts): the mainstream pop pattern of the file (four-on-the-floor-leaning kick, backbeat snare, 8th hats) at a general-purpose 120 BPM",
      "expanded to 2 bars (bar 2 starts as a copy of bar 1)",
      "velocity shaping applied to flat lane(s): snare(38), shaker(82) (grid formula; varied lanes keep source velocities)",
      "bar 2 variation: closed hat at step 30 converted to open hat (end-of-bar open hat)",
      "swing: groove source swing 0% converts to 500 permille; fixed style value 515 used",
      "fill: snare density ramp (8ths to 16ths) + tom run 48/45/43 + crash 49 on last cell",
      "v2 (2026-11-18): renamed Acoustic Pop; kit stays Programs/01-basic-kit.sfz (the only Virtuosity program whose keymap covers this pattern's keys incl. 46/82, probed 2026-11-18); FX retuned per the v2 brief (low shelf +2.5 dB, 250 Hz area cut via mid band, high-shelf air, bright plate-style reverb)"
    ]
